WEBVTT

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:17.390
Wow, now this is a surprise...

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:21.400
to be visited by No. I herself.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.730
If there is a mission
which only I can fulfill,

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:27.070
I would go anywhere.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:35.080
Are you gonna ask me
to return to Chronos again?

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.710
No...

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:42.540
Draw your Hades, Heartnet.

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:55.760
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:00:55.760 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:22.060
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:34.740
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:41.080
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:47.580
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:54.090
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:57.090
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:07.090
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:23.780
"Receding Cat"

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:41.060
We'll form a half-circle and launch
a concentrated attack. Let's go!

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:49.840
Humph... They mock us Chrono Numbers,
don't they, Nizer?

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:58.250
You bastard! Let Creed go!

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.020
It's too late.

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:04.650
This is the way... the Chrono Numbers live!

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:08.990
Creed!

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:47.130
N- Nizer!

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:55.610
Witness how the Chrono Numbers live!

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:20.160
Beluga!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.040
Beluga!

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:50.900
The destructive acts

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:56.400
by those calling themselves the
Apostles of the Stars continues worldwide.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.500
This video was sent
by the Apostles of the Stars

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:02.010
to news organizations around the world.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.710
It also contains a statement

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:08.350
by the person considered to be the leader
of this terrorist group.

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:09.870
Please take a look.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:14.020
My name is Creed Diskenth.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.180
I am the leader of
the Apostles of the Stars.

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:22.690
To all of you who are watching this video,
I shall reveal the truth.

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:24.030
The truth about Chronos,

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:26.030
the secret organization
which controls the world...

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:29.700
and how it will meet its end...

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.040
Chronos?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.370
What does he mean by control?

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:36.710
Never mind that. Let's go to the beach.

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:39.710
Those who wish to be free of them...

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.710
Come join me!

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:45.620
We, the Apostles of the Stars,
will free the world!

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:53.390
Let me ask you just one more time.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:56.060
Where is No. I?

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:58.060
I have no obligation to answer that.

00:05:58.060 --> 00:06:00.330
Do you belong to
the Apostles of the Stars!?

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:06.270
No, I am simply... one who harbors
a grudge against Chronos.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:17.350
The stability of the world is maintained
solely by the iron grip of Chronos.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.750
However, in this past month alone,

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:23.690
over ten nations have announced their
intentions of cutting ties with Chronos.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:30.030
Furthermore, our existence is
on the verge of being made public!

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:34.800
This all started when we allowed
Creed Diskenth and No. XIII's defection

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:37.030
from the organization!

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:40.040
And we are starting
to lose some of the Numbers.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:44.440
We cannot let this situation
continue any further!

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:52.380
It's likely that the elders are considerably
toughening their stance towards Sephiria.

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:55.390
Dammit! If only we had
been able to defeat Creed.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.720
Not only that,
we even lost Nizer and Beluga...

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:01.990
If you're thinking about them, then wait
until the right opportunity comes.

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:05.660
You can fight for them,
and bring Creed down.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.290
I know that!

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:16.010
Until the last head falls,
Cerberus is not dead!

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:20.010
During a long battle,
sometimes you need to bide your time.

00:07:20.010 --> 00:07:22.680
We will regroup our forces.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:25.020
You focus on healing your wound.

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:28.020
Well, I doubt we have time for that.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:29.690
Mason-<i>dono</i>!

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:32.020
Sephiria Arks...

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:34.360
Yes, Willzark-<i>sama.</i>

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:38.700
Can I expect that Chronos
will recover from this?

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:45.370
The replacements for Nos. X, V,
and XI are now being evaluated.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:48.100
I should be able to report
on the results shortly.

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:53.380
And as for the former No. XIII...

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:57.380
The Apostles of the Stars
are still like newborn babes...

00:07:57.380 --> 00:08:02.320
But given time, who knows
what monsters they will turn into.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:04.660
You're absolutely right.

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:08.330
We must not let it get away...

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:10.760
a golden opportunity, that is...

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:14.670
Belze... as of this moment,

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:18.000
I am temporarily turning over
the command of Chrono Numbers to you.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.340
VII and XII, please assist him.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:22.010
--Understood!
--Understood!

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:25.680
And what will you do in the meantime?

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:27.080
Sephiria...

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:40.690
There's no reason for you
to go see him, is there?

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:43.360
There is something I want to verify.

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:47.700
Are you going to verify it
by talking to him? Or by fighting him?

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:51.040
Please hold the fort for 24 hours.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.510
Got it. In your absence,

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.500
I will not allow the Apostles of the Stars
to step one foot in here!

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.230
I let him slip away...

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:41.610
Poke!

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:48.690
What's the big idea, princess!?

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:50.360
You're too slow, Train.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:52.700
What'd you say!?

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:54.700
Don't get so worked up.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:57.700
Since you said you wanted to do some
rehab now that your body is back to normal,

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:01.370
we're taking a vacation
and not looking for any new work.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:02.910
--Yeah, yeah...
--He's right!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.880
Before our measly savings run out,

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:07.040
get better so that you
can earn money again!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.050
Yeah, yeah...

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:12.380
You're more worried about money
than your friend's health!?

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:20.720
Well, there's such a thing
as priorities after all, and...

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:21.990
What's the matter?

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.970
Err... nothing.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.690
Draw your Hades, Heartnet.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:04.900
Sorry, I don't feel like it.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:29.730
I've left Chronos, but I have
no intention of fighting you.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:33.730
Heartnet, this freedom you gained...

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:36.700
is it the freedom to leave Chronos and die?

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:42.740
It's the freedom to continue living
the way I want outside Chronos.

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:46.640
Then, I want you to return Hades.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:52.070
That's right... you're the one
who gave it to me.

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:00.690
Let us fight together...

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:03.720
for Chronos and
the stability of the world...

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:14.040
A gun is merely a tool to kill people.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:17.310
Since you've sworn never
to kill anyone anymore,

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:20.040
you should not need Hades.

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:22.050
No can do.

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:25.050
For the lives that I've taken with this...

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:28.380
there're things that I have to do...

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.060
How unfortunate.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:36.930
Then, it seems I have no choice
but to take it away from your dead body!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:57.870
The rain was also icy cold that night...

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.650
Your mission...

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.860
So you've completed your mission?

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:31.050
Heartnet...

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:33.720
As you continue to fulfill your missions,

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.980
the day will come when you stop trembling.

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:44.730
However, you took a life...
you must never forget that feeling.

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:48.130
It is indeed the case that
we only fulfilled the mission

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:49.730
for the noble cause of Chronos.

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:53.400
However, we drew our weapons and struck.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:58.370
That feeling, that moment belongs to you;
you must always remember.

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:20.030
While I was in the Numbers, I had
forgotten your words from that night.

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:22.370
But now...

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:27.040
I feel that I finally understand
the sentiment behind your words.

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:30.040
The irony in killing for a noble cause...

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:35.050
Chrono Numbers are the ones
who should understand it the most.

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:36.710
It's impossible, Sephiria.

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:41.720
When you're in a high place,
you can't see your feet.

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:46.060
Are you saying that's why you left Chronos?

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:47.730
You're giving me too much credit.

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:51.400
The life of a stray cat
just suited me better. That's all.

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:53.730
It's unfortunate, Heartnet.

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:56.070
It's true that
there're those in the Numbers

00:14:56.070 --> 00:14:59.400
who feel no pain in
staining their hands in blood.

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:01.570
That's why I...

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:11.350
I intended to kill you
with my first strike...

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.410
I'd expect no less from No. I.

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:17.020
That was close!

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:19.690
However, you are already...

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.890
inside my barrier.

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:25.030
You will not get away!

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:26.700
Charden Flamberg!

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:29.030
A deserter of the Apostles of the Stars!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.370
Deserter!?

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:33.370
You are truly the captain
of Chrono Numbers.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.930
You know about me, too...

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:39.870
I'd suggest that you do not move.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:45.210
I see... So this is
what you mean by barrier.

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:47.720
Black Cat...

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:51.050
I no longer have to fight you.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.390
Please leave this place.

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:57.730
Why are you trying to kill Sephiria
when you've left the Apostles of the Stars?

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:02.670
Why? You ask me why?

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.670
What do you mean?

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:08.010
Chronos is a great evil
which threatens the entire world.

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:12.680
Didn't you leave the organization
because you could not accept that?

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:17.010
Well, the Apostles of the Stars are
just as bad as Chronos, aren't they?

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:19.020
You are absolutely right.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:23.020
That is why I chose
the same path you took.

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:27.020
You, of all people, should be able
to understand my way of living.

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.690
Sorry, I can't.

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:33.030
That is unfortunate...

00:16:33.030 --> 00:16:34.730
Black Cat!!

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:47.840
Now's my chance!

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.720
She found an opening!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.350
Better forget it.

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:26.350
You can't beat Sephiria.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:28.350
Chronos is a giant.

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:31.020
You've left the Apostles.

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:34.020
Do you think you can
defeat Chronos all by yourself?

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:36.690
That is why I became an assassin.

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:43.160
Even a lowly worm can bring down a giant
by directly attacking its central nerve!

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:47.370
How pitiful...

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:49.710
Then, you shall have your wish.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.380
Don't, Sephiria!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:55.380
This battle does not concern you, Heartnet.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:56.780
She is absolutely right!

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:02.320
I will fight to bring down the great evil,

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:04.580
even if it kills me!

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:07.960
It's useless.

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:20.500
Stop!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:56.040
Apostles of the Stars or
members of Chronos, I don't care...

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:59.570
I won't allow anyone to be killed!!

00:19:09.320 --> 00:19:15.490
So this is your battle, Heartnet?

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:20.330
There are other uses
for a gun besides killing.

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:23.270
I learned that from my best friend.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.230
Your best friend, you say?

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:31.510
Someone who taught me about freedom.

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:35.010
This is?

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:37.680
A bullet made of orichalcum.

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:40.050
I entrust this with you.

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:59.490
Heartnet, I will be looking forward to
seeing how you use that orichalcum bullet.

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:02.930
Sephiria...

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:08.710
I was unable to side
with the Apostles of the Stars...

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:11.380
nor was I able to bring down Chronos...

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:13.650
I am so powerless.

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.350
However...

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:33.400
Oh geez! Where the heck is
our breakfast cook wandering about!?

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:37.410
No breakfast today? Well?

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.100
I'm starving...

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:45.510
When'd he?

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:54.760
Hey, it's been a while since so many
of us were summoned together, hasn't it?

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:58.760
Yeah, looks like things
are kinda serious this time...

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:01.030
Kinda?

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:05.700
So what is No. VI doing
at a serious time like this?

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:09.040
Both the captain and I are
keeping tabs on his movements.

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:10.370
So there's no problem.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:15.050
I see. Acting alone, huh?
That's just like him.

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:19.380
Lin Shaolee, our newly appointed No. X.

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:22.490
As proof of your entrance
into Chrono Numbers,

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:24.390
I'm granting you this...

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:27.720
A veil made of orichalcum, Seiren...

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:30.060
Let us fight together...

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:33.400
for Chronos and the
stability of the world...

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:36.660
Yes, I would like to be of help.

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:46.410
Continue to carry your Hades, Heartnet.

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:52.420
But in doing so, you must continue
to prove your sentiments and beliefs.

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:54.910
Yeah, I know.

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:01.690
Sephiria-<i>san,</i>

00:22:01.690 --> 00:22:05.390
I have an idea...

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:21.040
<i>Since your new black boots</i>
<i>caused a blister,</i>

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:28.050
<i>you rest your right foot</i>

00:22:28.050 --> 00:22:38.050
<i>We'll keep walking along</i>
<i>with our own rhythm, without rushing</i>

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:51.560
<i>Don't say anything</i>
<i>because we'll soon understand each other</i>

00:22:56.110 --> 00:23:06.110
<i>I'm just holding you now to keep you warm</i>

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:20.360
<i>I'm completely wrapped around you, so...</i>

00:23:20.770 --> 00:23:30.770
<i>Quietly the powder-like snow</i>
<i>is building up...</i>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:42.390
"Next Episode"

00:23:42.390 --> 00:23:43.390
<i>What!?</i>

00:23:43.390 --> 00:23:46.060
<i>Creed and the others</i>
<i>are on the wanted list?</i>

00:23:46.060 --> 00:23:49.060
<i>And the reward is... 3 billion!?</i>

00:23:49.060 --> 00:23:52.400
<i>Even if you're not a sweeper,</i>
<i>you just have to go for it!</i>

00:23:52.400 --> 00:23:55.740
Not! <i>Who'd want to take a risk like that!?</i>

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:59.070
<i>I mean, they're a formidable bunch!</i>

00:23:59.070 --> 00:24:01.980
<i>There's no way there's someone</i>
<i>dumb enough to risk his life</i>

00:24:01.980 --> 00:24:03.350
"Cat that Hunts a Dragon"
<i>over a job like that!</i>

00:24:03.350 --> 00:24:04.940
<i>Oh, there is.</i>
"Cat that Hunts a Dragon"
